<title>USA: Donnelley Enterprise Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Donnelley Enterprise Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				 September 30		September 30</p>
<p>				1995	1996	 1995	 1996</p>
<p>   Total Revenues     21,080     25,780     42,188     71,023</p>
<p>   Gross Profit	  4,200	5,509	7,231     15,443</p>
<p> Selling Expenses	2,136	2,224	3,385	6,856</p>
<p> G &amp; A Expenses	  1,991	1,620	3,073	5,156</p>
<p> Special Charge	     --	  300	   --	  300</p>
<p>   Oper Earnings (Loss  (75)	1,136	  625	2,596</p>
<p>Earnings (Loss) Before</p>
<p>     Income Taxes	(148)	  949	  323	2,283</p>
<p>   Net Income (Loss)   (163)	  474	  100	1,096</p>
<p>Earnings (Loss) Per Share</p>
<p>			    (0.03)	 0.09	 0.02	 0.22</p>
<p> Avg Shares	  5,000,000  5,000,000  5,000,000  5,000,000</p>
<p>		  (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full company name is Donnelley Enterprise Solutions Inc. The company completed its initial public offering of 1.855 million shares of common stock and the offering of 1.005 million shares of common stock by R.R. Donnelley &amp; Sons Co on November 5.</p>
<p>Certain items have been reclassified to conform with current period classifications.</p>
<p>Income statement data for the nine months ended September 30, 1995 includes the results of operations of LANSystems, acquired in June 1995, beginning July 1, 1995.</p>
<p>Earnings for third quarter and nine months of 1996 include a special charge of $300,000 related to the departure of the former president of the LANSystems division.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
